The baseline numbers are all in place. Before writing the design doc, I'll verify the claims about the core mechanisms (atomic publish via rename, hardlink survival after pruning, flock-based collision detection, reader fd safety, danger of truncated files, missed detection of mtime preservation) with a small end-to-end script:
